{"notice_id":24514828,"sections":[{"kind":"SettledContract","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"CON-0000","values":[{"field_id":"BT-145-Contract","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-12-19"},{"field_id":"BT-1451-Contract","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-12-03"},{"field_id":"BT-150-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"Rahmenvertrag zur Belieferung mit Waren des Gastronomiebedarfes"},{"field_id":"BT-768-Contract","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"OPT-316-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"contract","type":"id","value":"CON-0000"}]},{"kind":"Lot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-0000","values":[{"field_id":"BT-115-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"BT-137-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0000"},{"field_id":"BT-21-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Rahmenvereinbarung zur Belieferung mit Waren des Gastronomiebedarfs"},{"field_id":"BT-22-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"InternalID","type":"id","value":"VgV/E/04/24"},{"code":"supplies","field_id":"BT-23-Lot","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-24-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Rahmenvertrag über die Belieferung mit Waren des Gastronoimiebedarfes an verschiedene Gastronomiestandorte der Auftraggeber."},{"code":"15000000","field_id":"BT-262-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"},{"field_id":"BT-536-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2025-01-01"},{"field_id":"BT-537-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2026-12-31"},{"field_id":"BT-54-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Der Auftraggeber hat das Recht, die Rahmenvereinbarung zweimalig für jeweils ein weiteres Jahr zu den vereinbarten Konditionen zu verlängern."},{"field_id":"BT-57-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Der Auftraggeber hat das Recht, die Rahmenvereinbarung zweimalig für jeweils ein weiteres Jahr zu den vereinbarten Konditionen zu verlängern. \nDer Auftraggeber teilt dem Auftragnehmer 6 Monate vor Ablauf der jeweils gültigen Vertragslaufzeit mit, ob er von seinem Optionsrecht Gebrauch macht."},{"field_id":"BT-58-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":2},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"fa-wo-rc","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"BT-99-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Der AG weist darauf hin, dass ein Nachprüfungsantrag nur zulässig ist, soweit:\n1. der Antragsteller den gerügten Verstoß gegen Vergabevorschriften im Vergabeverfahren erkannt hat, diesen gegenüber des AG innerhalb einer Frist von 10 Kalendertagen gerügt hat,\n2. der Antragsteller Verstöße gegen Vergabevorschriften, die aufgrund der Bekanntmachung erkennbar sind, spätestens bis zum Ablauf der in der Bekanntmachung benannten Frist zur Bewerbung oder zur Angebotsabgabe gegenüber der AG gerügt hat,\n3. der Antragsteller Verstöße gegen Vergabevorschriften, die erst in den Vergabeunterlagen erkennbar sind, spätestens bis zum Ablauf der Frist zur Bewerbung oder zur Angebotsabgabe gegenüber des AG gerügt hat,\n4. der Antrag auf Einleitung eines Nachprüfungsverfahrens innerhalb von 15 Kalendertagen nach Eingang der Mitteilung des AG, einer Rüge nicht abhelfen zu wollen, gestellt wird.\nWeiteres ergibt sich aus § 160 GWB."},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-AddInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-DocProvider","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0000","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"DE813441605"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0001","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#1","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"DE218114490"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0002","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#2","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"DE150524225"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0003","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#3","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"16900334-0001-29"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0004","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#4","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"DE815728669"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0005","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#5","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"002","type":"id","value":"0204:994-DOEVD-83"}]},{"kind":"ContractingParty","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","values":[{"code":"rcr","field_id":"BT-10-Procedure-Buyer","list":"authority-activity","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"pub-undert-ra","field_id":"BT-11-Procedure-Buyer","list":"buyer-legal-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-508-Procedure-Buyer","lang":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"https:/